	(text "VERIFY (unconfirmed items on this sheet):\n- X1: TCXO stock thin (718); buy before ordering.\n- R27: I2C pull-up value not fixed (PLAN 2.2-4.7k); no LCSC chosen. On +3V3D: ATtiny, Si5351, CP2102N and OLED all at\n   3.3 V, so I2C levels match.\n- R28: as R27\n- R100: 0603 0R series (Jason decision); LCSC code not in PLAN (C17477 is 0805).\n- C100: DC-block LF corner ~32 kHz into 50 ohm (PLAN Q6).\n- R101: DNP shunt ~120 ohm back-match of ~85 ohm source (datasheet Zo); part/LCSC not chosen; verify return loss esp.\n   >100 MHz.\n- L1: LPF inductor size (SMD vs T37 option, PLAN Q7)\n- C105: Parallel C across L (elliptic) per LowPassFilterModule - unconfirmed\n- C101: LPF values builder choice (DNP)\n- J2: Footprint is a placeholder; check BWSMA-KE-P001 launch geometry and 1.6 mm edge fit.\n- R120: see R100\n- R121: see R100\n- J3: see J2\n- R140: see R100\n- R141: see R100\n- J4: see J2"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 290 40 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1))
			(justify left top))
